worker_module_budget
  module "formal_ai_worker_format_conversion.js"
  ceiling 1134
  rationale "Browser twin of the issue #1177 JSON↔YAML format converter. Mirrors `handle_format_conversion` in rust/src/solver_handlers/format_conversion.rs: the same YAML subset (block mappings and sequences, two-space indent, scalars), the same refusal reasons (seed templates), and the same verify-before-show rule. JavaScript-first twin of native handler keys (format_conversion), added under R997-R999 (2026-10-06); growth is the ported handler, not silent regrowth. Ceiling moved 970 to 1098 for issue #1177 R9 (2026-10-07): CSV to JSON keeps every value a string and parses the JSON back cell by cell before answering, twin of format_conversion.rs. Ceiling moved 1098 to 1134 for issue #1173 R1173-3 (2026-10-08): a request naming only JSON as its target reads the source format from a payload that already parses as JSON (formatConversionJsonIdentity, twin of `json_identity`), and the YAML reader skips the cued request line instead of reading it as the first key."
